{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["And He said, <b>\"And YHWH has affirmed you this day\"</b> — for this day is for you like the day of Sinai, and HaShem exalted and magnified you in the acceptance of the Torah, that you should be for Him a treasured people above all peoples, and to keep all His commandments. For to you alone does He give His Torah, and He commands you in all the commandments that are desirable before Him — not to any other people, as it is written (Psalms 147:19–20): \"He declares His words to Jacob, His statutes and ordinances to Israel — He has not done so for any other nation.\""], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T02:55:58.809556486Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}